    <DemoExample Title="Expander icon" RazorCode="@example5RazorCode" Id="example5">
        <div>
            The expander is the chevron that turns over as the panel opens. <code>ExpanderIconName</code> and
            <code>ExpanderIcon</code> replace it, <code>ExpanderIconPosition</code> moves it to the start of the header,
            <code>HideExpanderIcon</code> removes it, and <code>NoExpanderRotation</code> keeps it still. Giving an
            <code>ExpandedExpanderIconName</code> swaps the icon for another one while the panel is open, which also
            stops the rotation - a swapped icon already reports the state on its own. For an expander that is not an
            icon at all, <BitLink Href="#example15">ExpanderTemplate</BitLink> puts any content in its place.
        </div>
        <br /><br />
        <div class="example-content">
            <div>ExpanderIconName &amp; ExpanderIcon:</div>
            <BitAccordion Title="ExpanderIconName" ExpanderIconName="ChevronDown">
                Every story starts with a blank canvas, a quiet space waiting to be filled with ideas, emotions, and dreams.
